# Character profiles live at /<REGION>/<Name> with no prefix (Shizu, 2026-09-22).
# One static app under /profile/ serves every name and reads the region and name
# back out of the address; its assets use absolute /profile/ paths for that
# reason. Same folder-not-index.html rule as above: /profile/index.html would
# loop through the 308.
#   NA and CE are the only codes the bracelet-bible worker accepts
#   (worker/bracelet.js validateNameRegion: "region must be NA or CE") and the only
#   ones on its board (leaderboard-seed.json slot 0). EU is what every loseii page
#   calls CE, so it routes too, and it is the spelling the app settles on.
/NA/* /profile/ 200
/EU/* /profile/ 200
/CE/* /profile/ 200
# Rule matching is case-sensitive, and a typed address is often lower case. The
# app rewrites these (and CE) to the canonical /NA/Name or /EU/Name in place.
/na/* /profile/ 200
/eu/* /profile/ 200
/ce/* /profile/ 200
